                Our Mission
              </h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white/80 text-base leading-[1.8] pl-11">
              To develop quality homes that enhance everyday living through
              thoughtful design, reliable construction, and a commitment to
              transparency.<br />We strive to create residential spaces that
              offer comfort, privacy, security, and lasting value while building
              enduring relationships with our customers through trust,
              integrity, and responsible development.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="w-16 h-[1px] bg-[#c7a469]/30 ml-11" data-reveal-item>
          </div>

          <div data-reveal-item>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-5">
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="28"
                height="28"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#c7a469"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                ><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"
                ></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg
              >
              <h3
                class="text-[#c7a469] text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase"
              >
                Our Vision
              </h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white/80 text-base leading-[1.8] pl-11">
              To establish Hindustan Developers as a trusted and respected name
              in residential real estate by combining our construction legacy
              with a forward-looking approach to modern living.<br />We aspire
              to create communities that stand the test of time - developments
              distinguished by quality, thoughtful planning, and a genuine
              understanding of what makes a house a home.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHY INVEST GOA -->
    <section
      class="relative bg-[var(--color-dark-section)] min-h-screen py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center w-full"
      data-reveal-group
      data-nav-theme="dark"
    >
      <!-- Background Image -->
      <img
        src="/images/inquiry-section-bg-image.png"
        alt="Goa Landscape"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-[65%] object-cover object-center opacity-40 mix-blend-overlay"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[var(--color-dark-section)]/20 via-[var(--color-dark-section)]/70 to-[var(--color-dark-section)]"
