      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-12 mb-28"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col" data-reveal-item>
            <div
              class="text-[#c7a469] text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 pl-2"
            >
              Why Invest
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
              <h2
                class="font-serif text-7xl md:text-9xl lg:text-[140px] leading-none text-[#f5f3ee] tracking-tight"
              >
                GOA
              </h2>
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="64"
                height="64"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#c7a469"
                stroke-width="0.75"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="hidden md:block"
                ><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"
                ></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"
                ></polyline></svg
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-white/80 text-base md:text-lg max-w-md leading-[1.8]"
            data-reveal-item
          >
            A unique blend of natural beauty, strong infrastructure, growing
            economy and a thriving lifestyle market makes Goa one of India's
            most attractive real estate destinations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-8 gap-y-16"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-item>
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="42"
              height="42"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#c7a469"
              stroke-width="1.2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="mb-6"
              ><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"
              ></path></svg
            >
            <h4
              class="text-[#c7a469] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Strong<br />Tourism Growth
            </h4>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-[13px] leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]">
              Over 10M+ annual visitors, driving demand for quality homes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-item>
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="42"
              height="42"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#c7a469"
              stroke-width="1.2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="mb-6"
              ><path
                d="M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.2-1.1.6L3 8l5.5 4L5 15.5 2.5 15 2 15.5l2.5 3.5L8 21.5l.5-.5-.5-2.5 3.5-3.5 4 5.5c.3.4.7.7 1.2.5l1.2-.8c.4-.2.5-.7.4-1.5z"
              ></path></svg
            >
            <h4
              class="text-[#c7a469] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Improved<br />Connectivity
            </h4>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-[13px] leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]">
              International airport, new Mopa airport and better road networks.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-item>
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="42"
              height="42"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#c7a469"
              stroke-width="1.2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="mb-6"
              ><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path
                d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"
              ></path></svg
            >
            <h4
              class="text-[#c7a469] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase mb-4 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Infrastructure<br />Development
            </h4>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-[13px] leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]">
              Roads, healthcare, educational institutions and urban amenities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-item>
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="42"
              height="42"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#c7a469"
              stroke-width="1.2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              class="mb-6"
              ><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"
